        "original_id": "93511ad6-20ad-5511-bb49-2fbb20985cad",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Kevin Rowland, Lauri Ylönen, Paul Speare\n- Bands: Dexys Midnight Runners, Dexys, The Rasmus, The TKO Horns\n- Products: My Beauty, \"Geno\", \"Come On Eileen\"\n\nFacts:\n- Kevin Rowland was born on 17 August 1953 and is an English-born singer-songwriter of Irish descent.\n- Paul Speare was born on 10 December 1955 and is a former member of Dexys Midnight Runners and The TKO Horns.\n- Lauri Ylönen was born on 23 April 1979 and is a Finnish singer-songwriter best known as the frontman of The Rasmus.\n- Dexys Midnight Runners, now called Dexys, had several hits in the early 1980s.\n- \"Geno\" and \"Come On Eileen\" both reached number one on the U.K. singles charts for Dexys Midnight Runners.\n- Kevin Rowland was the frontman of Dexys Midnight Runners.\n- My Beauty is a solo album by Kevin Rowland, the lead singer of Dexys Midnight Runners.",
